  description: A fortress given legs and a grudge. Nothing gets through a Colossus
    until everything does - the host builds them to define where the battle happens.
  tactics: Massive HP (miniboss bar), heavy contact, slow walk, no gun. It is terrain
    that moves. Do not duel it while anything else shoots - use its own shadow as
    cover from enemies above it, and grind it down when the screen allows.
